@startuml
title Cross-Chain Burn-and-Mint (ERC-7802 / Optimism Superchain)
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false

actor User
participant "SuperchainTokenBridge\n(source)" as SB
participant "CMTAT\n(source chain)" as CS
participant "L2ToL2\nCrossDomainMessenger" as MSG
participant "SuperchainTokenBridge\n(destination)" as DB
participant "CMTAT\n(destination chain)" as CD

User -> SB : sendERC20(to, amount, chainId)
SB -> CS : crosschainBurn(user, amount)
note right of CS
  onlyTokenBridge + whenNotPaused
  (pausing the token halts the bridge)
end note
CS --> SB : emit CrosschainBurn
SB -> MSG : send initiating message
... cross-chain relay ...
MSG -> DB : execute message
DB -> CD : crosschainMint(to, amount)
note right of CD
  onlyTokenBridge + whenNotPaused
end note
CD --> DB : emit CrosschainMint
@enduml
